From: BashKitten
Subject: Keep the Applications label beside its proportionally sized product icon

Only the owned BashKitten Applications launcher adds an image in labelled mode.
Other launchers and user show-label choices retain their existing behavior.

--- a/plugins/launcher/launcher.c
+++ b/plugins/launcher/launcher.c
